config HUAWEI_FINGERPRINT
	tristate "Huawei Qingyun L410 / Kirin 990 Fingerprint Sensor Bridge Driver"
	default y
	depends on ARM64
	help
	  This driver provides support for the Fingerprint Cards (FPC) sensor
	  on Huawei Qingyun L410 (KLVU-WDU0B) / Kirin 990, creating the
	  /dev/fingerprint device node and sysfs attributes for power, reset,
	  and interrupt notifications.

	  If unsure, say Y.
